      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EXCEED THE SALE (5) has impressed at both runs to date, each in midweek company. Made a move before the bend then went home far too well last start over 1200m at Eagle Farm. Should lap up the extra 150m and despite taking on a better field today another win is on the cards. HOT IMAGE (6) went from struggling at Ipswich to bolting in over 1200m here two Saturdays ago. The blinkers going on that day worked wonders. Doubt it was a fluke and happy to follow her as she gets out over a bit more ground. COURTHEZON (3) led from the outset and did find something extra when asked to get the cash over 1300m at Scone recently. Big step up in grade this time but respect the decision of the Archibald stable to come here. HIGH AUTHORITY (1) just missed in a race of questionable quality over 1400m at Eagle Farm three back. Each-way claims. MISSILE SHOT (8) ran on well but couldn't get near HOT IMAGE when resuming here last start. Likely improver, particularly over today's trip.",
